{"@type":"Question","name":"How long does a full-home renovation take?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on the size of the house, the scope and the permit review. After the consultation we give you a realistic schedule for design, permits and construction."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a full-home renovation cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The cost depends on the size, the scope and the finishes you choose. Detailed drawings and selections let contractors price the same job, so you can compare quotes and plan a realistic budget."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you work outside Toronto?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We are based in Etobicoke and work across the GTA, including Vaughan, North York, Mississauga, Richmond Hill, Markham and Oakville."}}]}
